hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16826","Abd Allah narrated to us, he said: Abu Musa al-Anazi narrated to me, he said: Muhammad ibn Uthma narrated to us, he said: Sa'id ibn Bashir narrated to us from Qatada from Abu Qilaba from Abu al-Sha'tha from Yunus ibn Shaddad that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) forbade fasting the days of al-Tashriq."
